                "description": "The Ribbon and Reed Knob is a classic of French Colonial decor. This traditional knobset will will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. The Ribbon and Reed Knob with Matching Ribbon and Reed Rose is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes.",
